# Build context is the repo root (deploy/docker-compose.yml). Host build output must never reach the
# image: a copied obj/ makes `dotnet publish` fail with duplicate assembly attributes.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
/artifacts/
deploy/profiles/
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
.git/
.vs/
.freebuff/
.orchestra/
graphify-out/
deploy/.env
**/appsettings.Local.json
